$DATUM 2,4-Diamino-5-(furan-2-yl)-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (8a). An argon-purged
mixture of 2,4-diamino-5-iodo-7-(β-
D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine 2729 (305 mg, 0.75 mmol),
furan-2-boronic acid (126 mg, 1.125 mmol), Na2CO3 (239 mg, 2.25 mmol),
Pd(OAc)2 (8 mg, 0.036 mmol), and TPPTS (53 mg, 0.093 mmol) in water/MeCN
(2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After cooling, the mixture was
neutralized using aq HCl (1 M) and concentrated to dryness in vacuo, and
the residue was purified by reverse phase HPFC (C-18, 0→ 100% MeOH in
water) to afford 8a which was crystallized from water. White needles,
yield 209 mg, 80%. Mp 234-236 °C. [α ]D -71.9 (c 0.313, DMSO). 1H NMR
(500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 3.52 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5′ a,OH = 6.0 Hz, J5′
a,4′ = 4.1 Hz, H-5′a); 3.61 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5′ b,OH = 5.2 Hz,
J5′ b, 4′ = 4.1 Hz, H-5′b); 3.84 (td, 1H, J4′, 5′a = J4′ ,5′ b = 4.1 Hz,
J4′ ,3′ = 3.3 Hz, H-4′); 4.06 (td, 1H, J3′ ,2′ = J3′,OH = 4.9 Hz, J3′ ,4′
= 3.3 Hz, H-3′); 4.34 (td, 1H, J2′ ,1′ = J2′,OH = 6.4, J2′ ,3′ = 5.2 Hz,
H-2′); 5.08 (d, 1H, JOH,3′ = 4.6 Hz, OH-3′); 5.18 (dd, 1H, JOH, 5′ a =
6.0 Hz, JOH, 5′b = 5.2 Hz, OH-5′); 5.28 (d, 1H, JOH,2′ = 6.3 Hz, OH-2′);
5.77 (bs, 2H, NH2-2); 5.96 (d, 1H,J1′ ,2′ = 6.4 Hz, H-1′); 6.47 (bs, 2H,
NH2-4); 6.55-6.59 (m, 2H, H-3,4- furyl); 7.40 (s, 1H, H-6); 7.73 (dd, 1H,
J5,4 = 1.7 Hz, J5,3 = 1.0 Hz, H- 5-furyl). 13C NMR (125.7 MHz, DMSO-d6):
61.95 (CH2-5′); 70.77 (CH-3′); 73.50 (CH-2′); 84.91 (CH-4′); 86.35
(CH-1′); 93.16 (C- 4a); 104.60 (CH-3-furyl); 106.73 (C-5); 112.00
(CH-4-furyl); 116.99 (CH-6); 141.56 (CH-5-furyl); 149.70 (C-2-furyl);
154.12 (C-7a); 157.84 (C-4); 160.13 (C-2). IR (ATR): ν 1609, 1579, 1478,
1444, 1126, 1010, 875, 792, 738 cm-1. MS (ESI) m/z 348 (M + H), 370 (M +
Na). HRMS (ESI) for C15H18N5O5 [M + H] calcd: 348.13025; found:
348.13034. Anal. (C15H17N5O5): C, H, N.
