$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: GENERAL PROCEDURE F: Suzuki A mixture of 72
(1.0 equiv), boronic acid (1.1 equiv),
tetrakis(trophenylphosphine)palladium (0) (0.08 equiv) and potassium
carbonate (2 equiv) in dimethoxyethane/water (10:1, 0.1M) was stirred at
110 °C for 1h under microwave in a sealed tube. The reaction was quenched
with a saturated solution of NaHCO3. The aqueous layer was extracted with
EtOAc. The combined organic layers were dried over anhydrous MgSO4,
filtered and concentrated in vacuo. The purification by silica gel
chromatography of the crude mixture yielded the expected compound.
2-(5-(3,4-dimethoxyphenyl)thiophen-2-yl)-1-methyl-3-phenyl-2,3-dihydroquinazolin-4(1H)-one
(76) The title compound was prepared following the general protocol F
using 72 (70 mg, 0.175 mmol), 3,4-dimethoxyphenylboronic acid (35 mg,
0.192 mmol), Pd(PPh3)4 (16 mg, 0.014 mmol) and potassium carbonate (48
mg, 0.374 mmol). The purification of the crude mixture by silica gel
chromatography (EtOAc/heptane 5/5) yielded the title compound
2-(5-(furan-3-yl)thiophen-2-yl)-1-methyl-3-phenyl-2,3-dihydroquinazolin-4(1H)-one
(91) The title compound was prepared following the general protocol F
using 72 (100 mg, 0.250 mmol), 3-furanylboronic acid (31 mg, 0.277 mmol),
Pd(PPh3)4 (23 mg, 0.020 mmol) and potassium carbonate (69 mg, 0.500
mmol). The purification of the crude mixture by silica gel chromatography
(EtOAc/heptane 4/6) yielded the title compound (77 mg, 80%), pale yellow
solid. 1H-NMR (400MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm) = 2.97 (s, 3H), 5.97 (s, 1H),
6.48-6.50 (m, 1H), 6.67 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 1H), 6.77 (d, J = 3.6 Hz, 1H),
6.83 (d, J = 3.6 Hz, 1H), 6.97 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 1H), 7.25-7.31 (m, 1H),
7.31-7.40 (m, 5H), 7.42-7.47 (m, 1H), 7.55 (brs, 1H), 8.12 (dd, J = 7.8
Hz, J’ = 1.5 Hz, 1H) 13C-NMR (100MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm) = 36.2, 78.0, 109.1,
113.2, 117.6, 119.4, 120.1, 122.3, 126.8, 127.3, 127.4, 129.2, 134.3,
135.4, 137.8, 138.5, 140.5, 143.7, 146.3, 161.9 MS (ESI) [M+H]+ = 387.1
LC/MS (XBridge 100 × 4.6 mm) : tR = 8.27 min, m/z : 387.1 ([M+H+])
Gradient A : tR = 21.85 min Gradient D : tR = 18.60 min I.R. (neat, cm-1)
3070, 2955, 2887, 1657, 1605, 1494, 871, 750, 695 HRMS m/z [(M+H)+] calcd
for C23H19N2O2S 387.1155 found 387.1167
